1
00:00:02,072 --> 00:00:03,802
Season two picks up right where we

2
00:00:03,822 --> 00:00:04,877
left off.

3
00:00:04,897 --> 00:00:07,577
The protomolecule has taken over Eros,

4
00:00:07,597 --> 00:00:10,002
the Rocinante crew is on the run,

5
00:00:10,022 --> 00:00:12,102
and Earth and Mars are edging toward

6
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:13,077
war.

7
00:00:13,097 --> 00:00:15,952
On Earth, Avasarala is playing a dangerous

8
00:00:15,972 --> 00:00:17,372
political game.

9
00:00:17,452 --> 00:00:19,797
On Ganymede, the breadbasket of the outer

10
00:00:19,817 --> 00:00:22,672
planets, trouble is quietly growing.

11
00:00:22,692 --> 00:00:23,947
Three stories again,

12
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:24,687
and this time,

13
00:00:24,707 --> 00:00:27,062
the alien thing is on the move.

14
00:00:27,082 --> 00:00:28,362
Spoilers ahead!

15
00:00:29,101 --> 00:00:31,556
Story one: Miller and the crew.

16
00:00:31,576 --> 00:00:34,281
Holden's team and Miller raid Thoth Station,

17
00:00:34,301 --> 00:00:36,906
the secret Protogen lab behind the Eros

18
00:00:36,926 --> 00:00:37,956
experiment.

19
00:00:37,976 --> 00:00:38,856
They win the fight,

20
00:00:38,876 --> 00:00:40,651
but the scientist in charge,

21
00:00:40,671 --> 00:00:44,226
Dresden, insists the protomolecule could turn humans

22
00:00:44,246 --> 00:00:45,551
into gods.

23
00:00:45,571 --> 00:00:47,351
Holden wants a trial.

24
00:00:47,371 --> 00:00:49,951
Miller decides that argument is over.

25
00:00:49,971 --> 00:00:52,141
The crew is learning to work together,

26
00:00:52,161 --> 00:00:53,941
but they don't always agree on what

27
00:00:53,961 --> 00:00:55,229
justice looks like.

28
00:00:55,829 --> 00:00:57,339
Then Eros starts moving,

29
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:58,614
all by itself,

30
00:00:58,634 --> 00:01:00,289
straight toward Earth.

31
00:01:00,309 --> 00:01:02,009
Earth fires nuclear missiles,

32
00:01:02,029 --> 00:01:04,814
but Eros goes stealthy and slips away,

33
00:01:04,834 --> 00:01:07,164
so the Rocinante paints it with lasers

34
00:01:07,184 --> 00:01:08,689
to guide them in.

35
00:01:08,709 --> 00:01:10,582
Miller rides into the station with a

36
00:01:10,602 --> 00:01:12,839
nuclear bomb and finds Julie,

37
00:01:12,859 --> 00:01:15,764
still alive inside the protomolecule.

38
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,889
He talks her out of hitting Earth.

39
00:01:17,909 --> 00:01:20,139
Eros crashes into Venus instead,

40
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,512
with Miller beside her.

41
00:01:22,241 --> 00:01:24,026
Story two: Bobbie.

42
00:01:24,046 --> 00:01:26,271
Bobbie Draper is a Martian Marine,

43
00:01:26,291 --> 00:01:27,321
tough and proud,

44
00:01:27,341 --> 00:01:29,821
guarding Ganymede, the moon that grows food

45
00:01:29,841 --> 00:01:31,541
for the outer planets.

46
00:01:31,641 --> 00:01:32,596
In her battle armor,

47
00:01:32,616 --> 00:01:34,796
she's basically a walking tank.

48
00:01:34,816 --> 00:01:37,266
One night, something attacks her squad.

49
00:01:37,286 --> 00:01:38,516
It isn't human.

50
00:01:38,536 --> 00:01:40,666
The fight sparks a battle between Earth

51
00:01:40,686 --> 00:01:42,741
and Mars above the moon.

52
00:01:42,761 --> 00:01:44,641
Bobbie is the only survivor,

53
00:01:44,661 --> 00:01:46,166
and her own side doesn't want to

54
00:01:46,186 --> 00:01:47,392
hear what she saw.

55
00:01:48,073 --> 00:01:49,728
Bobbie is sent to Earth for peace

56
00:01:49,748 --> 00:01:53,478
talks, where Avasarala sees what Mars won't.

57
00:01:53,498 --> 00:01:56,103
The blunt Marine and the sharp-tongued politician

58
00:01:56,123 --> 00:01:58,453
become an unlikely team.

59
00:01:58,473 --> 00:02:00,703
Bobbie defects to help expose the people

60
00:02:00,723 --> 00:02:02,228
behind the monster.

61
00:02:02,248 --> 00:02:05,053
Their chase ends on Jules-Pierre Mao's own

62
00:02:05,073 --> 00:02:06,653
yacht, where Bobbie,

63
00:02:06,673 --> 00:02:08,268
in full battle armor,

64
00:02:08,288 --> 00:02:11,118
arrives just in time to save Avasarala's

65
00:02:11,138 --> 00:02:11,845
life.

66
00:02:12,574 --> 00:02:14,704
Story three: Prax.

67
00:02:14,724 --> 00:02:17,304
Praxidike Meng is a botanist on Ganymede

68
00:02:17,324 --> 00:02:19,329
whose daughter Mei vanished just before the

69
00:02:19,349 --> 00:02:20,424
attack.

70
00:02:20,534 --> 00:02:23,414
As the moon's mirrors and greenhouses fail,

71
00:02:23,434 --> 00:02:25,639
refugees pack onto any ship they can

72
00:02:25,659 --> 00:02:26,639
find.

73
00:02:26,659 --> 00:02:29,514
Prax refuses to leave without his daughter.

74
00:02:29,534 --> 00:02:31,789
The Rocinante crew helps him search the

75
00:02:31,809 --> 00:02:34,299
wrecked station, and they find signs of

76
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:36,615
a hidden protomolecule lab.

77
00:02:37,346 --> 00:02:39,651
Then they discover a hybrid creature hiding

78
00:02:39,671 --> 00:02:40,826
on their own ship,

79
00:02:40,846 --> 00:02:44,866
fast, strong, and almost impossible to kill.

80
00:02:44,886 --> 00:02:47,101
Prax comes up with a clever plan,

81
00:02:47,121 --> 00:02:48,376
and they lure it out and burn

82
00:02:48,396 --> 00:02:50,851
it with the Rocinante's drive.

83
00:02:50,871 --> 00:02:54,125
Meanwhile, Naomi admits she secretly gave a

84
00:02:54,145 --> 00:02:57,041
protomolecule sample to Fred Johnson,

85
00:02:57,061 --> 00:02:59,141
so the Belt would have it too.

86
00:02:59,161 --> 00:03:00,735
The crew splits over it.

87
00:03:01,437 --> 00:03:04,272
Season two ends with Mei still missing,

88
00:03:04,292 --> 00:03:05,777
a secret lab on Io,

89
00:03:05,797 --> 00:03:08,012
and something strange stirring on Venus,

90
00:03:08,032 --> 00:03:09,837
where Eros crashed.

91
00:03:09,857 --> 00:03:11,837
Holden and Naomi aren't speaking,

92
00:03:11,857 --> 00:03:13,462
and Bobbie has a new boss in

93
00:03:13,482 --> 00:03:14,812
Avasarala.

94
00:03:14,832 --> 00:03:16,042
The war is close,

95
00:03:16,062 --> 00:03:18,592
and the protomolecule is waking up.

96
00:03:18,612 --> 00:03:20,676
Next up: season three.

